  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Import of second hand vintage clothing and training employees in clothing sorting centers in Nicaragua.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a working capital from DGGF Pre-finance Big Bag vintage wholesale BV will be able to to pre-finance the purchase of second hand vintage clothing from Nicaragua.

Big Bag is a wholesaler of (high-quality) vintage clothing, with a focus on &#x2018;American vintage&#x2019;. 

Big Bag strives to be the leading provider in the second hand vintage clothing market specializing in the style &apos;American vintage&apos;, both nationally and internationally by making sustainable vintage fashion accessible to everyone. 

They want to further strengthen their position by exploiting the national and international B2B market. With a focus on growth and innovation, they contribute to a (more) circular economy and encourage environmentally conscious clothing consumption.

Next to that, Big Bag creates local employment and economic growth by implementing training programs in a.o. Nicaragua. By doing so, it brings the sorting knowledge of suppliers to a higher level, reduces the waste &#x2018;mountain&#x2019; of clothing, and guarantees the purchase of sorted clothing at European rates.</narrative>
  </description>
